@startuml "Confirmation finale de commande"

title Confirmation finale de commande

actor "Utilisateur" as User
participant "Frontend\n(Next.js)" as Frontend
participant "API Gateway\n(Rate Limiter)" as API
participant "Auth Middleware" as Auth
participant "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "Database\n(PostgreSQL)" as DB

Frontend -> API: GET /api/orders/{orderId}
API -> Auth: Vérifier token
Auth --> API: user verified
API -> OrderSvc: getOrderById(orderId)
OrderSvc -> DB: SELECT order WITH tickets WHERE id=?
DB --> OrderSvc: complete order data
OrderSvc --> API: order details
API --> Frontend: order with tickets
Frontend --> User: Confirmation achat + billets

@enduml